\(match lang
  :zh_CN "用于将过滤表达式解析为抽象语法树（AST）的库。"
  :zh_TW "用於將篩選運算式解析為抽象語法樹（AST）的函式庫。"
  :ja_JP "フィルター式を抽象構文木（AST）に解析するライブラリです。"
  :ko_KR "필터 표현식을 추상 구문 트리(AST)로 파싱하는 라이브러리입니다."
  :es_ES "Una biblioteca para analizar expresiones de filtrado y generar un árbol de sintaxis abstracta (AST)."
  :fr_FR "Une bibliothèque pour analyser les expressions de filtrage et produire un arbre syntaxique abstrait (AST)."
  :de_DE "Eine Bibliothek zum Parsen von Filterausdrücken in einen abstrakten Syntaxbaum (AST)."
  :pt_BR "Uma biblioteca para analisar expressões de filtro e gerar uma árvore sintática abstrata (AST)."
  _ "A library for parsing the filter expression as an AST.")

```rust
use filter_expr::FilterExpr;

let f = FilterExpr::parse("name = 'John' AND age > 18").unwrap();

assert_eq!(f.expr(), Some(Expr::and_([
    Expr::eq_(Expr::field_("name"), Expr::str_("John")),
    Expr::gt_(Expr::field_("age"), Expr::i64_(18)),
])));
```

